        schema:contentUrl  <https://silknow.org/silknow/media/mtmad/32663_13.jpg> , <http://www.mtmad.fr/floracci/servlet/PhotoManager?recordId=musee:MUS_PHOTO:95066&idocsId=ged:IDOCS:111603&resolution=MEDIUM&timeStamp=1372753552391&imageScale=L396> .

